# T_SCRE: a level-1 user: the location types listed, Ins refused without
# a request; then the filter search by location: the pick list's first
# line, (no location), finding no item, then a location's code typed,
# whose path shows as the cursor leaves the field, finding its items.
S LTYPES
K INS
S RDINS
K ESC TAB F4
S PICKLOC
K ENTER
S NOLOC
K CTRL-S
S NONE
K ESC CTRL-Y
T b1
K TAB
S B1PATH
K CTRL-S
S ATB1
K ESC ESC
